x801 text "bounds"
x802 puts x800 x801
x803 call open x802 11
x804 write x803 2
x805 text "Bounds and safety"
x806 puts x804 x805
x807 call close x806 
x808 call open x807 2
x809 write x808 2
x810 text "Static caps: 65536 functions per program (also after linking), 4096 instructions per function, 64 parameters, arrays up to 65536 elements (1024 on the hardware and GPU targets), literal iteration budget 2^24 per function. Variable iteration counts are bounded by fuel in the reference interpreter; compiled targets have no execution budget. io output is bounded by the caller's buffer. There is no heap, no recursion, no exceptions, and no undefined behavior: div and rem by zero are defined, shifts mask the count, indices wrap modulo the array length."
